    "norm": "Tests {@link AccountingChronology#range(TemporalField)} as seen through a date's {@code range(field)} method. <p>The chronology under test uses a 13-month, 4-week-per-month division whose leap week falls in month 13, so a normal month spans 28 days (4 weeks) while month 13 spans 35 days in a leap year and 28 days otherwise."
